Bring in "core.syl" as core.
Bring in "ui.syl" as ui.

Please open a window with width 800 and height 600 titled "Syl Native UI".

Repeat while the window is not closing:
    Begin drawing now.
    Clear the background to white.
    Draw text "This is Syl running at Native Speed" at position 100, 100.
    End drawing.

Print "Window closed successfully.".
